Maintainer: SpliceFS <anthony@splicefs.org>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: passwd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/SpliceFS/server
Description: server of the SpliceFS read-only multi-source filesystem
 splicefsd serves local directories over HTTP so that SpliceFS clients can
 read each file from every node that holds a copy, at the combined speed of
 those nodes. It only reads; it never writes to a shared directory.
